silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_01_chunk_typing_concrete_anchor#evidencelegtypelabel silm:hasLongDescription "The EvidenceLegTypeLabel is the leg-type label \"evidence\" assigned to the Tartu vet-record chunk — it is an information artifact about Mittens, not a classification or quality measurement. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 't_chi', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
